entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.criticalhealth=I WILL NOT FALL HERE!!! 
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.criticalhealth.1=YOU CAN'T SLAY A GOD MORTAL!!! PARISH!!!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.criticalhealth.2=A GOD DOES NOT FEAR DEATH!!!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.criticalhealth.3=I WILL NOT LOSE!!!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.criticalhealth.4=MY WORLD IS NOT YOURS FOR THE TAKING!!! DIE!!!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.spawn=A mere mortal stepping into the land of the gods and defeating my daughter in battle? Very well, I will make sure you will regret your decision of coming here myself!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.spawn.1=My daughter... I will avenge your death with this mortal's blood... Prepare yourself %1$s!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.spawn.2=I have been watching you for long enough %1$s. Your treason will be met with utter annihilation!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.spawn.3=You dare step into my world and slay my daughter? I will make sure you regret your decision %1$s.
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.spawn.4=You are no god, but I shall feast upon your ignorance!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.spawn=Welcome to the end of the line %1$s!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.spawn.1=You will all parish the same! Fall before me!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.spawn.2=You chose the wrong time to storm into my dimension %1$s! Die!!!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.spawn.3=I will devour all of you and your worlds!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.spawn.4=I will destroy your world once I am done with you %1$s
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2=It appears that I have misjudged you %1$s. Your power has went beyond my expectations... But now it's time for you all to see my real power! 
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.1=I see.  You are much stronger than I could have ever predicted. Very well, I will show you what real power is!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.2=I misjudged you %1$s. You are no ordinary warrior. Very well, now is the time for you all to witness my true power!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.3=You are far stronger than I could have predicted %1$s. No matter. I will show you how powerful I really am!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.4=Impressive, most impressive mortal. Your determination has brought you this far, but how long will that last when I reveal my true power!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.start=Now it's time to meet your end %1$s!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.start.1=Witness my full power!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.start.2=All gods one and all, bare witness!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.start.3=For all of my people, I will bring you down!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.start.4=For all those who oppose me, bare witness to my full power!
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.dying=W-What?... N-No... I-It can't be...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.dying.1=Impossible... How in the...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.dying.2=No... No!... How can this be?...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.dying.3=Y-You... How in the...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.dying.4=No... No... No!... T-This is too soon...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.prematuredeath=Rrrrgh! Impossible!... T-This should not be possible!...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.prematuredeath.1=Aaagh! No! How can this be?!... You couldn't of...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.prematuredeath.2=Rrrrgh! How?! T-This should not be... Possible...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.prematuredeath.3=Aaagh! What in the?!... No!... No...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.prematuredeath.4=Roooaarrgh!... Noo!.... No....
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.dying=No..  I lost..  T-This is not the end...   I-I will return!  I...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.dying.1=I-It appears I was ignorant...  I-I can't believe I...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.dying.2=M-My world...  The world is going to end at your hands...  D-Damn you!...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.dying.3=No!...  You are going to destroy my world!..   H-How c-can't I beat you!...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.dying.4=I can't believe it...  I-I let my people d-down...   D-Damn you!...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.death=So... this is what defeat feels like...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.death.1=This... is.. the... end...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.death.2=No....
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.death.3=My... lady.... I'm coming... home...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase1.death.4=Heed my call... Frotheru... darkness... befalls us all....
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.death=Please... Leave my people alone %1$s... I... Beg of you...
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.death.1=Darkness... befalls... my... people....
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.death.2=I'm sorry... my... children....
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.death.3=%1$s... I must ask of you... to... leave.. my people... alone....
entity.darkness.dialog.phase2.death.4=My... people deserve peace %1$s... Please... treat them well....

