message.jzahar.denyheroism=Why would I want to become a 'hero'? It is you who need to learn how to go from zero to hero.
message.jzahar.scold=Do you except to plead, or die? Wait, that's right, I'm a Great Old One. It's best if you tell me you were just goofing around with that...
message.jzahar.collect=Don't keep me in here for too long.
message.jzahar.release=Woo. 10000 years will give you such a crick in the neck!
message.jzaharhelpful.snidecomment.jzahar=I had a bad time...and the birds stopped singing and the flowers started wilting, too.
message.jzahar.snidecomment.jzahar=Well, I've just wasted our time by fighting myself. Guess I'm becoming as crazy as you.
message.jzaharhelpful.snidecomment.sacthoth=He'll be back. I guarantee you he'll be back.
message.jzahar.snidecomment.sacthoth=The light is your destroyer! *rips invisible demon horns off his head*
message.jzaharhelpful.snidecomment.chagaroth=He isn't technically dead. All that's happened is that the dread plague's brain has been temporarily subdued. The Dreadlands are Cha'garoth.
message.jzahar.snidecomment.chagaroth=Now I know why my father Hastur and his brothers and half-brothers were afraid of you...to bad they aren't here to see my accomplishment.
message.jzaharhelpful.snidecomment.asorah=In the end, Asorah always belongs to Oblivionaire...he sounded pissed that his favorite pet lizard had re-died.
message.jzahar.snidecomment.asorah=And back to the pits from once yee came!
message.jzaharhelpful.death.1=Well, this is unexpected.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.2=Sorry, friend, but my puppet's been destroyed. I can't help any longer until you re-create it.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.3=But first, a quick reminder.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.4=I am a Great Old One. You shouldn't fear for me in any case.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.5=This simuraculum is spent, and I shall use another.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.6=But you... you'll bring me back. I know it.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.7=In a few seconds, I'll self destruct, and destroy any enemies in my vicinity.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.8=I wish you the best of luck without me, friend.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.9=Until the next time we meet, farewell.
message.jzaharhelpful.death.10=Take what's left of this simuraculum. At least I'll give back a little.
message.jzaharhelpful.banish.vanilla=Are you grinding? Probably. Or you're just lazy and can't fight him on your own. Oh well. *Obliterates the boss*
message.jzaharhelpful.banish.ac=I remember seeing you before...NOT DOING YOUR JOB!
message.jzaharhelpful.banish.jzh=Hello there, pretty mirror. BEGONE! *Creates sword out of thin air*
message.jzaharhelpful.banish.other=Who are you? It doesn't matter. You're an enemy, and I shall banish your soul to the steps of hell. Duh du du DUH!
message.jzaharhelpful.creative.1=%s, hello. I am J'zahar, but you already knew that. You're in creative?
message.jzaharhelpful.creative.2=Perhaps you're testing me? Bah hum bug! It matters not.